	(text "TODO (K-14, rev B): open-drain supervisor (TPS3840 class, ~3.08 V) wired-OR onto ESP_EN via 0R. Not drawn in rev A (DNP; no verified KiCad symbol/pinout).\\nPogo group (rear): TP1-TP7, TP9A/B-TP17 + TP18/TP19 GND = 20 pads. TP8 (IR shunt) lives on the B2B/IR sheet, DNP.\\nJ7 + UART0 series R: C6 first flash = J7 (C6_TXD/RXD/IO9/EN). No TP on CSI lines."
